      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(browser): time out download saves",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nBrowser download waits used the configured timeout only until Playwright emitted the download event. After that event, the timer was cleared before `download.saveAs(...)` ran, so a stalled save could leave the browser tool call hanging indefinitely.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nThe download capture now removes the event listener when the download is observed, but keeps the original deadline active until the save operation settles. If the save hangs, the same timeout rejects the tool call instead of waiting forever.\n\n## User Impact\n\nBrowser download tools now fail with the configured timeout when the browser starts a download but Playwright cannot finish saving it, making stalled downloads recoverable for agents and users.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Current head `e1bab3bd8458e35c71c452d092ed5111c48be881` passed `Real behavior proof` on GitHub Actions run `29630696107`.\n- Current head `e1bab3bd8458e35c71c452d092ed5111c48be881` passed `check-lint` on GitHub Actions run `29630528905`.\n- `git diff --check` passed.\n- Real browser download proof on Node `v24.18.0` with Playwright Chromium exercised the current `createDownloadCaptureForPage` implementation. It first saved a normal real download, then patched the real Playwright `Download.saveAs(...)` for a second real download so the save phase never settled. The existing deadline stayed active and rejected the waiter instead of hanging:\n\n```text\nnormal-save-path-basename: normal-artifact.bin\nnormal-save-content: browser-download-body\nnormal-state-depth-after: 0\nreal-download-event: url=http://127.0.0.1:60392/download filename=artifact.bin\npatched-saveAs-entered: targetBasename=.fs-safe-output-dcb09c84-d5b3-478a-a5c6-90b3dd447665-stalled-artifact.bin.part\nproof-head: e1bab3bd8458e35c71c452d092ed5111c48be881\nhttp-download-requests: 2\ncapture-armed: true\nsaveAs-call-count: 1\nobserved-rejection: Timeout waiting for download\nelapsed-ms: 666\nstate-depth-after: 0\nfinal-output-exists: false\nproof-result: PASS real browser download save stall rejected at configured deadline\n```",
